{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Sea Arena</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Deep Sea Arena, an intense underwater arena shooter where deadly creatures emerge from the abyss. Battle relentless waves of deep-sea horrors, dodge ambushes, and fight to stay alive. How long can you survive the depths?<br><br><strong>Fast-Paced Arena Shooter:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ever-Descending Platform:</strong> Your battleground continuously sinks into the ocean depths, ramping up tension as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depth-Based Highscores:</strong> The deeper you manage to survive, the higher your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Difficulty:</strong> Face increasingly dangerous waves of enemies as pressure, darkness, and limited space intensify.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constant Action:</strong> Quick reflexes and strategic movement are key\u2014there\u2019s no safe corner in this relentless descent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Enemies:</strong> Encounter a variety of <strong>deep-sea creatures</strong>, each with unique attack patterns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183330/extras/0af97d07f57e09280cce8498a47b4169.avif?t=1752534007\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183330/extras_big/0af97d07f57e09280cce8498a47b4169.avif?t=1752534007 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reached Surface","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183330/725913633a86d934fdd0164d30d9c9dd8c56f78a.jpg"},{"name":"Reached Twighlight Zone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183330/04bec34f65935ed4af5e0a459c4362570d09f